          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "abwägen is built on wägen \"to weigh\", an older form beside wiegen, from Proto-Germanic weganą \"to move, to carry, to weigh\"; EtymDB lists English weigh and Dutch wegen as its cousins."
